 Forrest and Oliver Soerensen were introduced to maintain energy levels. Despite Aberdeen's efforts to reduce the deficit, the home defense remained resolute. The final whistle at 90+5 minutes confirmed a masterclass performance built entirely in the opening 45 minutes, securing crucial points for the campaign ahead."
